 "description": "No room for it. UPDATE COMING SOON",
 "strategy": "Run it like TRM. ICFTC is huge in TRM. The deck’s not exactly force choke, but if your opponent doesn’t get many icons of his own accord, it could function that way, especially with Goo out. No SAC- not with four sevens and not enough deck space. I’m looking for more Rebel Artilleries. No backup Luke- I could care less if he dies, even in the unlikely event he does, what with Fallen Portal and Bionic Hand (V). I don’t have any retrieval, which could be a problem, I was thinking about podracing, but I don’t have a system to control, nor space.\n\nAgainst a space deck just set down and drain at the Back Door and Landing platform, supplemented with Rebel Artillery and Lightsaber Proficiency. You’re pretty sunk, though.",
